        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Rockwood RM4450 Centrex 36\" Curved Door Pull </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRockwood's Centrex 36\" Curved Pull features smooth curves that create a distinctive look and inviting focal point for your entrance.  Available in 5 beautiful finishes.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of 3 different materials in 5 finish choices.\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Bronze: Oil Rubbed Bronze.</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass: Polished Brass or Satin Brass finishes.</li>\r\n<li>Solid 304 Stainless Steel: Polished Stainless Steel or Satin Stainless Steel finishes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Rockwood RM4450 36\" Curved Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 37\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hardware: 1/4-20 </li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Bar Stock</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please order 1 right hand and 1 left hand pull.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
